   Output (LLM answer): {"task": "factory_info", "query_nl": "What are the possible next stations after Station2?", "response": "From Station2, the next stations can be Station3 with probability ... and Station4 with probability ...."}
3. Input (Natural Language Query): How many stations are there in the production line?
